msgid "Open it with %{hotkey}, the shortcut of the Open context menu quick action."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:339
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The context menu can also be placed as the first item of the main menu, so bot"
"h menus are available after pressing Alt. Press Tab to reach the checkbox and "
"choose whether it should appear there; you can change this later in the progra"
"m settings. Whenever an option seems to be missing, check the context menu fir"
"st; that is usually where it lives."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:342
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"One more shortcut worth remembering is %{hotkey}: wherever you are, it reads t"
"he additional keyboard shortcuts and hints available for the control that curr"
"ently has focus."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:345 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:346
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Finding your way around"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:348
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Display context menu in menu bar"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:359
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The main window greets you with a list of Quick Actions: shortcuts that take y"
"ou straight to the places and commands you use most, such as opening Messages,"
" publishing to the feed or entering a conference channel. The default set cove"
"rs the essentials, but all of it is yours to change. Shortcuts assigned to hid"
"den actions remain active. You can also use a Quick Action's context menu at a"
"ny time to move, rename, hide or delete it, assign a hotkey to it, add further"
" actions or restore the defaults."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:361 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:366
#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:368 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1785
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Quick Actions"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:364
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Press Tab to choose which actions should be visible in your Quick Actions list"
"."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:372
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Actions visible in the Quick Actions list"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:434
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Invisible Interface"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:435
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten does not stop being useful when you switch to another program. The Invis"
"ible Interface is a set of global hotkeys that work across the whole system wh"
"ile Elten is running, so you can check new messages, browse the feed or contro"
"l a conference without leaving the application you are in. Its content is arra"
"nged into cards, such as Messages, Feed and Conference options: hold the Elten"
" modifier keys and use the arrow keys to move between cards and their items, p"
"ress Enter to activate one, or add a command key, for example M to write a mes"
"sage or F to publish to the feed. The complete list is available under Help, L"
"ist of Invisible Interface hotkeys."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:438
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The currently selected modifier combination is %{keys}. If you would rather us"
"e a different one, press Tab to choose it from the list."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:440
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"If you would rather use one particular modifier combination, press Tab to choo"
"se it from the list."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:442
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "The Invisible Interface"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:454 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:615
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Do not change"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:459
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Modifier keys"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:487 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:489
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Sounds and sound themes"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:490
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten deliberately speaks less than it could: much of what happens is signalle"
"d by short sounds instead, such as reaching the edge of a list, a new message "
"arriving or someone joining a conference. You will pick most of them up natura"
"lly as you go. The Sounds guide lets you listen to each one together with its "
"description and remains available from the Help menu.\n"
"\n"
"If you would prefer Elten to sound different altogether, the community shares "
"sound themes that replace the whole set. The sound themes manager lets you bro"
"wse, download and select them and remains available under Sound themes in the "
"Tools menu. Press Tab to reach the Sounds guide button, then Tab again for Sou"
"nd themes."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:492
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Open the Sounds guide"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:494
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Manage sound themes"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:504
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "A rewritten server"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:505
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The rebuild does not stop at the client: Elten 3.0 talks to a completely rewri"
"tten server API. In practice this should mean noticeably smoother operation, e"
"specially when the network is under heavy load, and reliable service for many "
"different clients and platforms working at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:509
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Programs from Elten 2.x"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:510
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Programs written for Elten 2.x cannot run in Elten 3.0 and are not carried ove"
"r during the upgrade. Compatible versions of the official programs are availab"
"le from Program centre in the Programs menu, and later in this wizard you will"
" be offered a few of the most useful ones. When an installed program has an up"
"date available, Elten 3.0 lets you know through a notification."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:514
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Notifications instead of What's New"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:515
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The What's New screen from Elten 2.x is gone. In its place, Elten 3.0 receives"
" notifications from the server, so the same items, and their read state, are s"
"hared by every supported client. New notifications appear in the Notifications"
" section of the main window, and the complete list is kept under Notification "
"history in the Community menu. To decide which kinds of account activity shoul"
"d notify you, open Manage my account and choose Notifications."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:519
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Voice message transcriptions"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:520
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Audio posts on the forum have long been accompanied by text transcriptions, an"
"d Elten 3.0 brings the same to private conversations: voice messages can now c"
"arry a transcription as well. A transcribed message can simply be read whereve"
"r listening would be inconvenient. You can also decide, in the program setting"
"s or later in this wizard, whether audio content should play automatically: al"
"ways, never, or only when no transcription is available."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:524
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:525
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten 3.0 introduces a calendar, which you will find in the Community menu. It"
" is a place to plan your events and keep track of what is coming up, for yours"
"elf and with others. Besides your personal calendar, you can create more, shar"
"e a calendar with another user, or publish a language-specific public calendar"
" for anyone to subscribe to, so it covers everything from private appointments"
" to events for a whole community."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:529
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:530
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Alongside the calendar, Elten 3.0 also introduces tasks. A task can carry a de"
"scription, a due date and a person responsible for completing it, and tasks ar"
"e grouped into projects: besides your personal list, you can create a project "
"and share it with other users, who receive an invitation and can then plan the"
" work together with you. It suits anything from a simple to-do list to a proje"
"ct run jointly with friends."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:534
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Activity statistics"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:535
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Until now, a summary of the past year's activity was sent out on the first day"
" of each new year, and only some could read it: it reached Polish-speaking use"
"rs who were active around that time, and it existed only in Polish. Elten 3.0 "
"replaces that tradition with something better. Activity statistics are now ava"
"ilable to everyone, for any year and at any time, under Manage my account. You"
" can check how many forum posts, messages, blog posts and comments a year brou"
"ght, how much time you spent in conferences and how often you signed in; each "
"year can be compared with the one before, and rankings show, among other thing"
"s, the forums you used most and the people you wrote with most often."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:539
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Audio on the feed"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:540
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Feed entries can now speak: publishing entries with audio is a premium option,"
" described in detail under Premium packages in Manage my account. When composi"
"ng an entry, the Attach audio button records a clip on the spot, and the recor"
"ding travels with the text: entries carrying audio are marked on the feed and "
"play straight from the list, with no need to open anything. To everyone who ch"
"ooses to support Elten's development this way, thank you."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:544
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Honors are back"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:545
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Honors are back. Once among Elten's most cherished features, they quietly died"
" a natural death some years ago; Elten 3.0 hereby restores them, and several e"
"ntirely new honors arrive alongside the familiar ones. As before, they are awa"
"rded automagically as your activity earns them: the Veteran honor grows with e"
"very year spent on Elten, a devoted correspondent becomes a Courier, appearing"
" in enough contact lists makes you a Celebrity, and being mentioned all over t"
"he forum and blogs earns the title of Talk of the Town. Most honors have level"
"s to climb. The full collection, and everyone who holds each honor, can be bro"
"wsed from the Users menu, and the honor you are proudest of can be set as your"
" primary one: it is then announced in place of the word User whenever someone "
"opens your visiting card."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:549
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Now, over to you"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:550
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"That is the end of the news. From here on, the wizard becomes practical: the f"
"ollowing pages will help you review and refresh what Elten knows about you, fr"
"om your languages and profile details to account security, and adjust a few se"
"ttings along the way. Wherever everything is already in order, the correspondi"
"ng page simply will not appear, so this part may turn out pleasantly short."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:559 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:561
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Keyboard behaviour on macOS"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:562
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten on macOS can follow either the native macOS conventions or the Ctrl-base"
"d Windows layout that older Elten versions used. The keyboard style decides wh"
"ich modifier keys Elten shortcuts expect: Command and Option, or Ctrl. Charact"
"er navigation separately decides whether the Left and Right Arrow keys review "
"text the macOS way or the Windows way. Press Tab to reach the keyboard style l"
"ist, then Tab again for character navigation; both can also be adjusted at any"
" time under Tools, Program settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:567 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:574
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Use the system default"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:567
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Use the Windows keyboard style"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:567
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Use the macOS keyboard style"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:568
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Keyboard style"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:574
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Use macOS-style character navigation"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:574
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Use Windows-style character navigation"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:575
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Character navigation"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:591 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:610
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Your main language"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:594
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Elten could not load your current main-language setting."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:596
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Your account does not have a main language set."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:598
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Your current main language is %{language}."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:601
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Choose a language only if you want to replace the setting that could not be re"
"ad. Otherwise, select Do not change and review it later in your account settin"
"gs."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:603
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Your main language tells Elten which language community you belong to: it is u"
"sed to recommend forum groups, deliver language-specific notifications and mat"
"ch you with content you can read. It does not change the language of the Elten"
" interface."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:605
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"It matches the language of the interface, which is usually exactly right. Chan"
"ge it only if you prefer community content in another language."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:607
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The Elten interface is currently set to %{language}. Using different languages"
" for the two is perfectly fine; this page simply asks you to confirm that the "
"difference is intentional."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:609
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Press Tab to reach the language list."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:619
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Main language"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:633 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:643
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Other languages"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:636
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load your other language settings. Any languages selected here"
" will replace the unread setting. Leave every item unticked to make no change "
"and review it later in your account settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:638
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"If you are comfortable in languages besides your main one, you can list them h"
"ere, and Elten will include community content in those languages as well. This"
" is entirely optional; leave every item unticked to make no change."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:640
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Press Tab to reach the list. The other languages stored on your account are al"
"ready selected. Elten uses this list when including language-specific communit"
"y content. Leave the selection as it is to make no change."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:647
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Additional languages"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:664 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:673
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Public name"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:667
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load the public name currently stored on your profile. Enter a"
" name only if you want to replace it. Leave the field empty to make no change "
"and review your profile later."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:669
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Alongside your username, your profile can display a public name. Many people u"
"se their real name, but any name the community knows you by will do. It is opt"
"ional and does not change the name you sign in with. Leave the field empty if "
"you would rather not display one."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:671
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Press Tab to reach the name field. This name appears on your public profile al"
"ongside your username. Edit it if it is out of date, clear it to remove it, or"
" leave it as it is."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:674
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Full name or preferred public name"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:680 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:689
#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:695
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Gender"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:684
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Gender is an optional profile field. Besides appearing on your profile, it let"
"s Elten choose the correct grammatical forms when referring to you in language"
"s that need them. Your current setting is %{gender}. Choose the appropriate va"
"lue, or Do not specify if you would rather not share it."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:686
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load your current gender setting. Choose Female or Male only i"
"f you want to set it now. Leave Do not specify selected to make no change and "
"review your profile later."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:692
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Do not specify"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:705 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:724
