"omatically follow its forums or threads. Leave every item unticked to make no "
"change."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:875
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"These recommended groups match your languages, and you are not yet a member of"
" any of them. Tick the communities you would like to join; Elten will join the"
"m when you finish the wizard. Joining a group does not automatically follow it"
"s forums or threads, so you remain in charge of what you hear about. Nothing i"
"s ticked by default."
msgstr ""

